    [
     2,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div> </div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br></div><div>If lavaan does not estimate the covariance, q2 it is possible to modify the default with: <div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#008\">fixed</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">x </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> FALSE</span></div></code></div>to estimate the covariance.<br></div></div></blockquote><div><br></div></div></div>"
